# Provider API keys for the orchestrator's model-agnostic clients.
#
# You do NOT have to edit this file by hand — the UI has a 🔑 API keys panel
# (Panel 1) that writes these into a gitignored .env and applies them live.
# To use a file instead: copy this to `.env` and fill in the keys you need.
#
# Only the providers you actually use need a key. The Claude client is the
# `claude` CLI and needs no key here (it uses its own auth).
#
# Each key name below is the `apiKeyEnv` of a client in config.json → "clients".

# DeepSeek — https://platform.deepseek.com/api_keys
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=

# OpenAI — https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
OPENAI_API_KEY=
